# Build context: the repository root (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to
# the Dockerfile). Only the generator (apps/forge) and the service (apps/api) are sent.
*
!apps/api
!apps/forge
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/.data
**/.env
**/.env.*
apps/api/tests
apps/forge/tests
